flowchart TB
  accTitle: Ptah product journeys
  accDescr: Desired schema sources and the current database produce a reviewable plan. Versioned SQL files or direct apply change the target database. Inference builds and verifies a separate candidate before switching the active pointer; rollback switches it to an eligible previous generation.
  subgraph schema[Schema changes]
    direction LR
    sources["Schema sources<br/>desired state"] --> plan["Compare and plan<br/>review the changes"]
    live["Live database<br/>current state"] --> plan
    plan --> files["Versioned migrations<br/>reviewed SQL files"]
    plan --> direct["Direct apply"]
    files --> target["Target database"]
    direct --> target
  end
  subgraph inference[Persistent inference state]
    direction TB
    subgraph build[Build and verify a candidate]
      direction LR
      spec["Specification<br/>model and source rows"] --> candidate["Candidate build<br/>isolated generation"]
      candidate --> verify["Verify<br/>required checks"]
    end
    subgraph pointers[Switch the active pointer]
      direction LR
      active["New active<br/>previous retained"] -. rollback if eligible .-> previous["Previous active"]
    end
    build -->|cutover| pointers
  end
  schema ~~~ inference
  class plan,verify decision
  class candidate candidate
  class target,active,previous active
